  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How Long Have I Been Waiting for You**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **banjo tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Crawdad Song**: back after 180 archived shows (1225 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Pancho & Lefty**: back after 197 archived shows (1309 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Should Have Been Home**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Lonely at the Top**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Rabbit in a Log - Freedom**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Rabbit in a Log**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-06-02.MK41.seedy** (recommended): audience recording; 35 songs; 204 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper recorded from section 113, row G, in the middle of the Moody Center in Austin [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-06-02.MK41.seedy**: taped by seedy; transferred by seedy; source: Audience->Schoeps MK41-Schoeps KCY-Naiant IPA-Sony PCM-A10-cdwav->mp3tag for tagging->Traders Little Helper->recorded by seedy [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [6]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-06-03 Moody Arena Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-06-03-moody-arena-regular/) [8]",
